[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706043095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114528#issuecomment-3706043095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114528","id":3706043095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c5brX","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T19:03:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T19:03:40Z","body":"The error is misleading (fixed in 4.6) and reference pack (which is always `res://assets.sparsepck`) instead of actual file that is failing.\n\nThe issue seems to be underscore in the folder name (`_assets`), grade build ignore all file in the folder for some reason, if it's removed, it is working as expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706043095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706129676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114528#issuecomment-3706129676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114528","id":3706129676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c5w0M","user":{"login":"ryan-linehan","id":12516772,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTE2Nzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12516772?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan","html_url":"https://github.com/ryan-linehan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-linehan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T19:57:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T20:00:59Z","body":"> The error is misleading (fixed in 4.6) and reference pack (which is always `res://assets.sparsepck`) instead of actual file that is failing.\n\nJust to be clear the fix you are referencing from 4.6 is a more clear error message? I attempted to go to the 4.6 dev version to see if it would fix my issue but it did not.\n\n> The issue seems to be underscore in the folder name (`_assets`), grade build ignore all file in the folder for some reason, if it's removed, it is working as expected.\n\nI removed the _ from assets folder name and it does seem to work now in the minimal repro project! Thank you! I do believe we should still fix the root cause of the issue since _assets should be a valid folder name.\n\nOut of curiosity how did you actually identify that was the cause? I was trying to figure this out myself for awhile but didn't put that together. Thanks again!\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706129676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706136472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114528#issuecomment-3706136472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114528","id":3706136472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c5yeY","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T20:02:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T20:02:08Z","body":"> Just to be clear the fix you are referencing from 4.6 is a more clear error message?\n\nYes, it's only about more readable error, showing both pack and file name instead of pack name only. It won't fix the issue.\n\n> The issue seems to be underscore in the folder name (_assets)\n\nSeems like it can also be worked around by changing default ignore patterns in the file `gradle.build` file (either after instating template or inside template itself):\n\n```diff\n-ignoreAssetsPattern \"!.svn:!.git:!.gitignore:!.ds_store:!*.scc:<dir>_*:!CVS:!thumbs.db:!picasa.ini:!*~\"\n+ignoreAssetsPattern \"!.svn:!.git:!.gitignore:!.ds_store:!*.scc:!CVS:!thumbs.db:!picasa.ini:!*~\"\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3706136472/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]